BEHAVIOR t2-build-header

DESCRIPTION
  Writes the fixed 56-byte HTTP/1.1 POST header
  ("POST / HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: localhost\r\nContent-Length: 11\r\n\r\n") into the
  header buffer and sets length = 56. Takes no body input, so its output buffer
  cannot alias any data buffer; the producer sends this header, then the body
  bytes, as two separate sends.

CONTRACT
  OUTPUT header bytes 256
  OUTPUT length int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 71237cc1

IMPLEMENTATION
    STORE header 80 1 0
    STORE header 79 1 1
    STORE header 83 1 2
    STORE header 84 1 3
    STORE header 32 1 4
    STORE header 47 1 5
    STORE header 32 1 6
